  "instructions": [
    "To prepare the cabbage, cut it into thin slices and soak in cold water for 30 minutes to remove excess bitterness. Drain and pat dry with paper towels.",
    "In a large skillet, heat the olive oil over medium heat. Cook the sliced onion until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "To assemble the bowls, place a portion of the cabbage mixture into a mason jar, followed by a dollop of additional fresh dill and a sprinkle of toasted bread crumbs.",
    "Refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld together. Serve chilled, garnished with additional fresh dill if desired."
